      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>护甲（轻甲），非普通（需同调）</em><br />这套护甲具有5发充能。穿着这套护甲期间，你可以用附赠动作消耗1发充能来用这套护甲，以自己为目标施展以下法术之一：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.1B8U6kl0egesx3FK]{跳跃术 Jump}</em>（1充能）或<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.GNvrHluGdgqD06wZ]{浮空术 Levitate}</em> （2充能）。<br />这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d4 + 1]]发已被消耗的充能数。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Cambria;mso-hansi-font-family:Cambria\">该护甲由坚固而柔韧的皮革制成，其表面由紧密的铆钉和尖刺进行加固。</span></p></div></div><p>This armor has 5 charges. While you wear it, you can use a bonus action to expend 1 or more charges to cast one of the following spells from the armor, targeting yourself: @spell[Jump] (1 charge) or @spell[Levitate] (2 charges).</p><p>This armor regains [[/r 1d4 + 1]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Made from tough but flexible leather, studded leather is reinforced with close-set rivets or spikes.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
